<title>ALBANIA: Albania January CPI rises 1.6 pct m/m, 16.9 yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Albania January CPI rises 1.6 pct m/m, 16.9 yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albania's Institute of Statistics reported the following inflation data on Thursday:</p>
<p> ALBANIAN INFLATION	   JAN 97     DEC 96    JAN 96</p>
<p> Monthly CPI change (pct)    +1.6	 +0.7	+2.03</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change		+16.9	+17.4	+6.31</p>
<p> Index (Dec 1993=100)	 146.49     144.15    125.28</p>
<p>-- Tirana Newsroom +355 42 62228</p>
</text>
